    "    \"display(Markdown(\\\"## 📊 Assignment 4 — Key Findings Summary\\\"))\\n\",\n",
    "    \"display(Markdown(\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### Part A — Data Cleaning\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- **Missing values:** 0 (HR dataset is clean)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- **Duplicates removed:** Varies by dataset version\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- **Outliers detected** via IQR method across all numeric columns\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- **Winsorization** at 5th/95th percentile effectively capped extreme values in `average_montly_hours`\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- **Data types** validated and corrected (categorical columns converted to 'category' dtype)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### Part B — Data Integration & Transformation\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- **Split/merge simulation** confirmed zero data loss — index-based join is reliable\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- **Min-max normalization** scaled all features to [0, 1] range, enabling fair comparison\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- **Z-score standardization** centered features at 0 with unit variance — outliers clearly visible in box plots\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- **Equal-width discretization** of `last_evaluation` into 4 bins revealed right-skewed performance distribution\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
