    "    \"- **2D PCA plot** showed partial Rock/Mine separability (~45-50% variance in first 2 PCs)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- **t-SNE** produced clearer cluster boundaries but sacrifices interpretability and global structure\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
